<title>AUSTRALIA: INTERVIEW-Fairfax says 97/98 start stronger.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW-Fairfax says 97/98 start stronger.</headline>
<byline>Kevin Morrison</byline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Fairfax Holdings Ltd finance director John Greaves said on Tuesday the newspaper group had started the 1997/98 year on a stronger note than in the same period a year earlier, helped by a firmer advertising market.</p>
<p>However, Greaves said it was too early to say whether the current year profit would be above the A$85 million pre-abnormal net profit recorded in the latest syear to June 30.</p>
</text>
